WEBVTT

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:40.290
It will not be much longer 
before Alice is born.

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:42.210
Father...

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:45.620
Father?

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.020
Shinku.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.760
Suiseiseki. Kanaria.

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:57.860
H-Hold on!

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:59.300
Father?

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:02.100
But Rozen will only 
meet with Alice, right?

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:06.100
Father is enraged.

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.900
Your beloved father has a wish...

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:12.340
Why are none of you moved to grant it?

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:17.850
The Alice Game...

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:20.080
W-Why you...

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:23.580
I understand, Father.

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:24.800
Shinku!

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:40.830
Well then...

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:44.470
Tomorrow morning in the N Field...

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:58.050
Rose Garden

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:05.480
Could this be possible?

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:09.220
That Father's together 
with Bara-Suishou...

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:11.060
It does not matter.

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:15.070
We have no choice but to fight now.

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:18.630
Why are you taking orders 
from a guy like that?

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:21.520
It has become clear.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:26.680
If I am to take back 
Souseiseki's Rosa Mystica...

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.080
...I cannot avoid the Alice Game.

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:30.680
That's...

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.570
I'm sure there must be 
other ways to do that.

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:35.320
Hey, I'm right, aren't I?

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:38.510
U-Um...

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:41.560
You remain here.

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:43.330
W-What do you mean by that?

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:44.830
That is right.

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:48.000
Having you scurrying around
will only be a hindrance to us.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.380
D-Don't underestimate me, I guess?

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:51.070
Kana is...

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:55.310
Your wobbly violin 
performance is not wanted!

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:00.430
Let's go, I guess, Pizzicato?

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.220
I would like some tea.

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:31.630
Jun, did you not hear me?

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:33.120
Tea...

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.190
I don't get it.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:38.350
You said you wouldn't fight.

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:42.250
Both you and Suiseiseki...

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:47.590
That guy... is Rozen?

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.830
So you had met Father before...

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:57.780
Having met him doesn't change anything!

00:04:58.390 --> 00:05:02.050
What I know is as good 
as if I knew nothing!

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:03.840
I...

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.970
I can't do anything...

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:14.540
Jun.

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:22.090
I want you to come with me.

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:46.920
Hina-Ichigo entrusted
her Rosa Mystica to Shinku.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:51.040
She will be together with Shinku,
as she was before...

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:53.890
And you too, Souseiseki...

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:06.400
You will be together with Suiseiseki
forever and ever, too.

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:11.270
Kana, look, look!

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:14.740
I had them turn those photos
from the other day into posters!

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:16.950
See? See, see?

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:20.280
Oh, they're all beyond cute!

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:24.580
I got a custom-made size
for the shot of you and Hina together!

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:26.640
Where should I put them up?

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:28.730
Oh, that's right!
 I have to buy frames too.

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:30.730
It'd be a shame to put 
them up with tacks.

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:33.490
That just leaves placement.
I'll put this in the middle and...

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.390
Okay, time to eat!

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:50.370
Flower-topped hamburger steaks
first thing in the morning...

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:54.500
Oh, I have to get going!
I have a practice match today.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:02.860
I'll cook something even more
amazing for dinner, okay?

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:04.410
So...

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:09.280
Hurry on... back, okay?

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:14.610
W-Well, I'm off!

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.530
Nori...

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:29.040
Hello there!

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:32.060
That voice...

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:33.540
Kanaria!

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:37.950
We told you not to come.
You have such a hard head.

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:42.320
The Alice Game can't begin
without Kanaria, I guess?

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:45.320
After all, I'm the best tactician
among the Rozen Maidens...

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:48.850
If it gets dangerous,
stick your chin out and run, you!

00:08:56.850 --> 00:08:57.870
Here we go.

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:15.010
Ow.

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:37.740
Shinku!

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:43.240
Father!

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:49.920
R-Rozen...

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:56.420
Please listen to me, Father!
I do not think fighting is...

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:00.050
How dare you gainsay Father.

00:10:00.050 --> 00:10:00.830
It is unforgivable.

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:13.540
Jun...

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:15.080
Shinku...

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:32.360
You will return Souseiseki's 
Rosa Mystica!

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:38.090
Getting one more before 
I defeat Shinku...

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.360
...might be nice too.

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:52.310
K-Kana can too!

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:58.360
Here I go, I guess?

00:10:58.360 --> 00:10:59.880
The Wild Rose Prelude!

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:16.950
Huh? It's not working at all, I guess?

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:22.870
Second Movement,
March of the Dispirited Soldiers!

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:26.880
You offend my ear!

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:40.990
Get on out of here, Kanaria!

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:42.350
Hurry!

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:45.850
Giving your friend a chance to escape...

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:48.080
You seem terribly confident.

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:49.430
Suigintou.

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:53.690
But I wonder how far 
you'll get on your own.

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:57.970
Oh, where were you aiming?

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:03.110
You want Souseiseki's 
Rosa Mystica, don't you?

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:07.880
Your precious, precious 
younger sister's soul...

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:09.010
Why you!

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:11.080
I have something neat to show you.

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:19.070
To be defeated by these shears...

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:20.690
You couldn't ask for a better way to go.

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:23.700
Wouldn't you say so, Suiseiseki?

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:51.460
Shinku!

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:56.290
Shinku...

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:57.300
Rozen!

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:02.970
Shinku came here to stop the Alice Game.

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:05.040
Please listen to me. They're...

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:16.010
<i>To think Kana's best 
attack had no effect...</i>

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:20.640
<i>Maybe I should've stayed home
like Shinku and the others said...</i>

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:23.750
Oh? One of them is missing...

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:27.360
Oh no.

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:39.670
B-Bara... It's Bara-Bara, I guess...

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:46.950
You have no time to be 
distracted, now do you?

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:51.180
Not when your opponent
is none other than Suigintou!

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:53.230
S-Shinku!

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:17.010
I swear. You are so much trouble!

00:14:17.010 --> 00:14:19.320
Do not just stand there. 
Hurry along now!

00:14:19.740 --> 00:14:20.680
Wait!

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:25.440
W-What do you think you're doing?

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:27.350
You will escape from this doorway!

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:30.090
There is no knowing what you might do...

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.950
...so I will come with you partway, you!

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:35.160
Escape?
 K-Kana can still fight...

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:38.310
You were crying your eyes out!
Do not argue with me!

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:43.470
I do not...

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:48.970
...want to see a Rosa Mystica
stolen right before my eyes again.

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:54.640
Suiseiseki...

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:08.660
Now, we are going!

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:09.920
Hurry, you!

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:10.660
R-Right!

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:28.750
It's Bara-Bara again, I guess?!

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:32.380
Do not think about unnecessary things!

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:34.380
Make for the doorway, Kanaria!

00:15:34.960 --> 00:15:36.260
B-But...

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:37.480
Never mind! Just hurry!

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:57.850
Suiseiseki!

00:16:06.470 --> 00:16:08.210
Give it up now.

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:13.740
I'm... I'm coming now, I guess?

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:16.820
Your Rosa Mystica will also...

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:19.060
I'm coming!

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:21.960
...be mine.

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:28.470
Suiseiseki!

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:30.740
It's my turn to save you now, I guess?

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:32.130
You idiot!

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:33.940
Why did you come back?

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:35.140
Hurry up and run, you!

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:39.080
How can you say that, I guess?

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:48.800
Fine.

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:51.390
I was going to take both anyway.

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:53.120
Run, you!

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:09.540
S-Suiseiseki...

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:25.460
Y-You!

00:17:25.630 --> 00:17:27.650
Hey, are you listening to me?

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:33.930
There is no reason to grieve.

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:39.940
The sacred Alice Game
has properly advanced forward.

00:17:42.350 --> 00:17:43.440
No!

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:53.660
I'll protect you, I guess?

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:56.820
Are you taking what is not yours?

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:00.160
Give it back.

00:18:00.860 --> 00:18:04.660
Give back Suiseiseki's Rosa Mystica.

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:09.300
N-No, I guess?

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:10.800
Get real!

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:12.600
L-Let go!

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:13.970
Why you...

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:15.700
What the heck do you guys...

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:19.830
Beautiful...

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:24.300
The red of rage burning quietly...

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:25.860
Shinku...

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:32.480
Get serious about this.

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:34.790
Otherwise,

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:39.290
it'll mean that you let
Suiseiseki die right before you.

00:18:43.110 --> 00:18:45.580
Requiem for Time Lost!

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:52.640
<i>What Kana can do...</i>

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:53.840
<i>That is...</i>

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:58.540
<i>I have to protect her, I guess?</i>

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:15.120
<i>I have to protect 
Suiseiseki's Rosa Mystica!</i>

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:19.570
So you've finally become 
serious about this.

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:40.890
<i>Suiseiseki, lend Kana...
Lend Kana your strength!</i>

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:08.910
N-N-No, I guess?

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:15.290
I'm going to... I'm going to protect
Suiseiseki, I guess?

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:18.790
D-Don't come any closer, I guess?

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:21.430
I can do it too, I guess?

00:20:21.430 --> 00:20:25.530
This time... This time, I'll be the one
to help everyone, I guess?

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:30.270
I'll never, never let you 
have Suiseiseki, I guess?

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:32.040
I'll protect her without...

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:36.660
...fail,

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:40.910
I guess...

00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:57.900
N-No...

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:01.780
Y-You can't go...

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:04.610
Suiseiseki...

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:10.860
Micchan...

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:35.540
K-Kanaria...

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:38.000
Suiseiseki...

00:23:42.730 --> 00:23:46.060
Ever since then,
 I have always wished for...

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:48.260
...just one thing.

00:23:49.690 --> 00:23:51.420
I have always believed...

00:23:51.710 --> 00:23:53.360
...just one thing.

00:23:54.310 --> 00:23:57.610
Before Father, Alice will now...

00:23:59.110 --> 00:24:02.270
Next time on Rozen Maiden Träumend.

00:24:02.970 --> 00:24:05.900
Its melody is like a dream.

00:24:03.190 --> 00:24:10.850
Chapter 12
Alice
